  "details": "I mostly use the phone app to see what friends are playing the game at any given time.\n\nCurrently, when you go to the socials tab and click \"online\" friends, it shows you a list that includes not only people in-game, but also on third party apps as well. And there's no way to filter them out.\n\nIt makes the list much longer and less convenient to go through when you just want to see who's online at a glance. So I would like to suggest adding another filter, next to sorting by name or activity, to filter just for who is \"in-game\" at the moment and only show those friends. The previous version of the app could do this, so it seems odd that it lost that feature in the new version.\n\nThank you.",
